            "text": "STS adheres to NIST SP 800-88 Rev. 2 media sanitization standards, DOD 5220.22-M sanitization protocols, and HIPAA 45 CFR §164.312 privacy requirements. All downstream processing complies with California DTSC universal waste frameworks to ensure zero landfill disposal for Kern County organizations."
