            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We provide commercial electronics pickup throughout Bakersfield, Oildale, Rosedale, Shafter, Wasco, Delano, Arvin, and surrounding Kern County industrial corridors. Our logistics network offers flexible scheduling for energy producers, packaging facilities, and enterprise offices across Central California."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How quickly can commercial pickup be scheduled in Bakersfield?",
