        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is commercial electronics pickup free for Bakersfield businesses?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We provide complimentary pickup for qualifying commercial quantities of IT hardware, computers, and enterprise electronic assets throughout Bakersfield and Kern County. Contact our logistics coordinators at 844-699-2913 to review inventory eligibility and schedule dedicated transport."
