            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS provides HIPAA 45 CFR §164.312 aligned digital media destruction for healthcare networks such as Kern Medical and Adventist Health. Our procedures include executed Business Associate Agreements, serialized audit trails, and physical drive destruction to render protected health information permanently unrecoverable."
